        {"area": 12140.0, "latency": 1303.0},
        {"area": 12140.0, "latency": 1303.0},
        {"area": 12140.0, "latency": 1303.0},
        {"area": 12140.0, "latency": 1303.0},
    ],
}

# Scaling factor to convert floating-point values to integers
